@startuml
title Sprint 3 Sequence Diagram - Admin resolves report
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

actor Administrator as Admin
boundary View
control Controller
entity Service
database Repository
control Notifier

Admin -> View : opens workspace
View -> Controller : fetch open reports
Controller -> Service : listOpenReports()
Service -> Repository : findOpen()
Repository --> Service : reports
Service --> Controller : report list
Controller --> View : report list
View --> Admin : render queue

Admin -> View : clicks \"Assign\"
View -> Controller : assignReport(reportId, adminId)
Controller -> Service : assignReport()
Service -> Repository : findById(reportId)
Repository --> Service : report
Service -> Repository : update(report)
Repository --> Service : saved
Service --> Controller : updated report
Controller --> View : updated report

Admin -> View : show report detail\nenters note, clicks action
View -> Controller : resolveReport(reportId, note)\nor dismissReport(reportId)
Controller -> Service : resolveReport() / dismissReport()
Service -> Repository : update(report)
Repository --> Service : saved
Service -> Notifier : notify(reporterId,\nREPORT_RESOLVED)
Notifier --> Service : notification created
Service --> Controller : final report state
Controller --> View : final report state

View --> Admin : show confirmation\nremove from queue
@enduml

